# TAZUNA: only what is listed below goes into the repository (an allow-list).
#
# Everything else in this folder stays on the robot's computer: run records and photos (runs/), old versions
# (backups/, with the un-wiped originals of the test photos), video material (video/), what is on the gripper
# right now (tool_active.json), review and research notes (refs/ except urdf/ and gripper/).
#
# - A new top-level file needs a line here, otherwise git does not see it.
# - Inside the published folders only the listed kinds of file are taken.
# - Photos are never taken by a pattern. A photo goes in only after someone has looked at it at full size and
#   wiped what should not be public: `git add -f <photo>`, then `python tools/privacy_wipe.py accept`.
#   `python tools/privacy_wipe.py check` refuses a tracked photo that is not on the reviewed list or has changed
#   (run it before every commit; a local pre-commit hook can do that).
# - NEVER run `git clean -x` or `git clean -X` here: for git all the private folders above are "ignored files",
#   and it would delete them.
# - `fd` rewrites some tracked files in normal use (config.json and the calibration files): read `git diff`
#   before a commit.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/DESIGN.md
!/INTEGRATION_NOTES.md
!/LICENSE
!/NOTICE
!/PROGRESS.md
!/README.md
!/fd
!/calib_points.json
!/camera_model.json
!/config.json
!/probes.json
!/blockfit.py
!/camera.py
!/capfit.py
!/fakebus.py
!/fastcam.py
!/fd.py
!/fdtypes.py
!/grasp.py
!/gripper_model.py
!/ink.py
!/kinematics.py
!/kinfit.py
!/nlq.py
!/penskill.py
!/phys_bus.py
!/robot.py
!/scene.py
!/servo_bus.py
!/sheet.py
!/sim_bus.py
!/sim_fuzz.py
!/simpaper.py
!/skills.py
!/strokes.py
!/takeout.py
!/test_bus_fake.py
!/test_grasp.py
!/test_ink.py
!/test_integration_pen.py
!/test_kinematics.py
!/test_motion_phys.py
!/test_penskill.py
!/test_scene.py
!/test_sim.py
!/test_skills.py
!/test_strokes.py
!/test_tooling.py
!/test_tracking.py
!/tooling.py
!/tracking.py
!/vision.py
!/drawings/
!/testdata/
!/tools/
!/refs/

/refs/*
!/refs/urdf/
!/refs/gripper/

# inside the published folders: only these kinds of file, whatever else is dropped there
/drawings/**
!/drawings/**/
!/drawings/**/*.json
/testdata/**
!/testdata/**/
!/testdata/**/*.json
!/testdata/**/*.npy
# an unused copy of tools/pen_draw/pen_state.json
/testdata/pen_20261111/pen_state.json
/tools/**
!/tools/**/
!/tools/**/*.py
!/tools/**/*.json
!/tools/**/*.md
/refs/urdf/**
!/refs/urdf/**/
!/refs/urdf/**/*.urdf
!/refs/urdf/**/*.xml
!/refs/urdf/**/*.stl
!/refs/urdf/README.md
/refs/gripper/**
!/refs/gripper/**/
!/refs/gripper/**/*.py

__pycache__/
.*/
.#*
